| Source                                | What it is                               | Use it for                                            |
| ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| **SEC EDGAR XBRL API**                | Official 10-K/10-Q numbers, free, no key | Revenue, COGS, net income, EPS, dividends (10+ years) |
| **yfinance** (`pip install yfinance`) | Yahoo data, unofficial                   | Share price history (needed for P/E and yield)        |
